# mekiri-host runtime state (audit log, config, session library) created by
# actually using prune/sprout -- SECURITY: this holds session distillates,
# which can contain whatever the user or an agent put into the conversation,
# secrets and personal data included. Never remove this line, and check any
# other project you wire Mekiri into has the equivalent -- see
# packages/mekiri-proxy/INSTALL.md for the reasoning.
.mekiri/

